    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-8 md:p-12 prose prose-lg max-w-none">

        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Your garage holds the bikes, the tools, and probably a door straight into your kitchen. So how do you secure a garage door? Start with the door that leads into your house. Then protect the emergency release, find out what code type your opener uses, and stop leaving the remote clipped to the car visor. None of it takes long, and most of it you can do this weekend.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#A61E22] bg-[#F8F8F5] px-6 py-4 my-8 not-italic">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-2">Key Takeaways</p>
