            <li>Shield the emergency release, or tie it the safe way, so it still works from inside.</li>
            <li>Opener code type, not home age, decides how exposed you are to code attacks.</li>
            <li>Keep remotes out of vehicles.</li>
          </ul>
        </blockquote>

